{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d5_level_act15d5_st04","groupId":"act15d5","stageId":null,"title":"信仰號街車","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st04.txt","sourceHash":"7d88bc3bf9bc72212a8a1204adcdb5ac845f92ca00f67e93c89418152715768e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為了解決修道院的財政困難而遠赴龍門的席德佳順利完成了工作，卻在閒暇之餘開始思考自己與這片大地的聯繫。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我們的姐妹，席德佳。今日，我們將為你送行。\n願光芒鋪陳你的前路，願虔誠與信念永伴你身。\n蘭登修道院的鐘聲將穿過漫長......呃？什麼？\n咳，蘭登修道院的鐘聲將穿過漫長的歲月，將這數百年來的......葡萄酒！？\n喂，怎麼還剩下葡萄酒？哪來......呃，瞞著老頭子偷偷帶來的？噓！噓！\n總而言之願蘭登百年的榮光與你同在！席德佳！快來幫忙！幫忙把酒桶撬開！\n嘿嘿，送別的話果然還是少不了這個吧？在老頭子回來之前，乾杯！\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我睡著了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在敲門......已經這個時間了！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"早安，席德佳修士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......早安，或者說午安，拜松先生，久違地躺在床上，我似乎有些懈怠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"長途勞累，辛苦您了。我是來向您確認今天的行程的，沒有打擾到您休息吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，也辛苦你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"從拉特蘭......那個遙遠的國家來到龍門，不是一場輕鬆的旅途吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我第一次離開拉特蘭這麼遠......原來長途旅行，不止是欣賞風景那麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，就算是經驗老道的信使，也會選擇各種各樣的辦法排解情緒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"信使們也很不容易呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那席德佳小姐，請問昨晚的住宿還滿意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。距離市中心很近，價格也很便宜，你的眼光很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"其實費用這方面，您不用擔心的。峯馳物流會報銷您在龍門期間的出行費用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不，作為蘭登修道院的一員，我並不願在財富上仰仗他人，請原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，我正是為了解決修道院的各種難題才遠走他鄉，總不能過分奢求別人的地主之誼，自己享樂吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣......真是令人欽佩的精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"只是必修課罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"和歐厄爾先生的會面安排在明天晚上，那請問您今天有什麼打算嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......在附近稍微逛逛吧。這還是我第一次來大炎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，需要安排導遊或是隨行人員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不。我想自己隨便看看。只是滿足自己的好奇心而已，不好麻煩各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣的話......我也就不打擾您的雅興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......冒昧地問一下，歐厄爾先生，是您的父親，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，是的，怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我失禮了。只是拜松先生在工作的時候，完全把歐厄爾先生當做上司看待......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，如果我總是依賴著老爹這層關係的話，那還怎麼越過他這道高牆呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，拜松先生原來也是個很有野心的人嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，要不是和席德佳修士聊得來，我也不會和客戶說這種話題喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，不打擾您了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不過如果您有空的話，我想聽聽拉特蘭的故事。就像您對龍門的好奇心一樣，我對那裡......也有著各種想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"好，祝您今天玩得愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒有什麼旅遊經費......隨便逛逛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟“機遇和信仰，都在集市與鐘聲裡”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你爹太頑固啦！這裡可是龍門欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"可這手藝，是我們老家那邊代代傳下來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這都什麼年代了，手工怎麼賺錢嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......也對。那是得說服說服我爹去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"還有幾號排到我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"21號，快了，馬上就到我們了。這家甜品店生意怎麼這麼好啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是31號啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"好甜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......您、您是不是拉特蘭來的那位客人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？您知道我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是，其實因為某些原因我家現在住不了人，近衛局給我安排的住所和您是同一家酒店......呃，其實就在您的對面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是這樣......那還真是巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，失禮，我該先做自我介紹的。我是拉特蘭蘭登修道院所屬，請叫我席德佳。您是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不用尊稱的，我只是一個普通的工程師......工程師代號是雪雉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過，您這樣身份的人，為什麼不住在更高級一點的套房裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......我也有點苦衷啦，不過更多的是為了提醒自己。也不用對我這麼客氣，現在我只是在旅遊中而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"給，你要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......小蛋糕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"本來看很有名，就多買了兩個，沒想到口味會這麼激烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果這樣的東西能廣受歡迎的話，也許修道院的一些商品未必適合龍門呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以給我嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊，可以啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"謝、謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼像餓了三天的瘤獸似的......）咳咳，吃慢點啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......雪雉，是吧？能不能陪我多走一段路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"咕，哈。沒、沒問題大人！今天我休假！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別喊大人啦，有點不好意思......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不知不覺，已經到夜裡了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不見鐘聲的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳姐姐，怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒有。只是覺得時間過得真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟今天是休息日，塞車太嚴重了，只是稍微在龍門市中心逛一逛，就天黑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......雪雉，哥倫比亞又是個什麼樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？我想想......總、總之一切都亮閃閃的，科技感很強，而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"有點不近人情......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"當、當然，我只在研究所和周圍的地方待過，不如說離開工作地點兩公里以外的地方就完全沒有去過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，那段兩點一線的生活......胃不舒服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......當我沒說，別勉強自己啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"......席德佳姐姐，蘭登修道院......是什麼樣的地方？我只聽說過公證所......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......麵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"麵包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"是一座建立在麥田和山丘之上的，古老的修道院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"起初是為了訓練保衛教宗的戰士，與公證所和教宗騎士最大的不同在於，蘭登修道院接納來自大地各國的人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"咕，但是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這幾年太和平了！公證所基本把我們工作搶光了！今年連一個新生都沒有！老頭子們也說著要讓修道院學會自力更生而拒絕撥款！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......要倒閉了啊。歷史悠久的蘭登修道院要因為財政問題倒閉了啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳姐姐，修道院該用倒閉這個詞嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個詞太貼切了，沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"所以席德佳姐姐才離開了拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......總得想想辦法啊。幸虧修道院的名聲在外，雖然有些人覺得我們只剩下些花架子，但起碼我們還有一大片麥田......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"今天麻煩你了，雪雉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒關係！今天本來就沒有別的安排......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"我就在152房，如果姐姐有什麼別的事的話，可以來找我......在家裡打掃完之前，我都會住在這裡的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，席德佳修士，歡迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"歐厄爾先生，很榮幸能與您會面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，放輕鬆些，席德佳修士，我們的企業文化不喜歡過於拘謹的會面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，關於從蘭登修道院來往龍門的商業條款——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......您很厲害。您早就準備好了所有的規劃，其實今天，只是告訴我這一切而已，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......太完美了。只靠我如今的見識，完全沒辦法在信使相關的工作上與您相提並論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，能得到拉特蘭修道院修士的認可，是我的榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"歐厄爾先生，請恕我冒昧，我想以個人名義問您幾個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼選擇蘭登修道院？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是峯馳物流這樣規模的公司，想鋪設信使通道、完善系統程式的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡的話，能與蘭登修道院這樣悠久的機關合作，我們深感榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"——您知道，一家物流公司所能觸及到的極限距離嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是我的峯馳物流，也不過觸及到龍門及周圍五座大炎城邦而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏薩斯或者維多利亞呢？龍門是大炎的重要對外樞紐，那麼國外的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"和大部分普通市民所想的不同，物流公司其實極難在註冊國以外的地區有任何發揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"即使合法過境後，大部分民事物流公司業務都會轉交給當地的合作方或政府信使機構，可沒有哪個國家寬容到縱容別國信使在自家地盤隨便亂竄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"當然......這只是“明面上”的運作模式，不過灰色的部分並不在我們需要探討的範疇之內，不用介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"誠如您所說，在資訊、中轉等各方面建立起穩定的連結所需要的成本，和修道院帶來的商品利潤是完全不成正比的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅是天災信使駐紮基站這一項成本，就高得驚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這是一條連通向拉特蘭的道路。您應該明白這其中的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是我所希望的藍圖的其中一環，而在這條道路的盡頭，信使們將會翻過文化與種族的壁壘，我們的雙手將可以觸及整片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，因為各種各樣的原因，這件事幾乎不可能實現。種族，文化，歷史，還有時不時來添麻煩的天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上有太多因素決定了各國不可能打成一團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們要熬過戰爭，要對抗天災，也許這件事根本不可能在這片分離且隔閡的大地上順利推進——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"但這並不代表......橋樑不被允許存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我們就該先試著分開巨浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"透過某些手段，我瞭解到......教宗本人似乎對這類想法的態度非常寬容，因此，拉特蘭也許是我們某個嘗試方向的第一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳修士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不，抱歉，我沒想到能聽到如此的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的兒子知道您的這份，呃，宏偉藍圖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不，他還需要磨煉。我說過，這份事業絕非一朝一夕，我不會是那個親手搭建橋樑的人，也許他是。也許，他也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"但他可是我的兒子，這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......蘭登修道院能與貴司合作，將會是一次寶貴的經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"我深感榮幸，席德佳修士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......說實話，歐厄爾先生，我的想法很簡單。我很喜歡我的修道院，我也認為蘭登修道院優良的文化值得延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不希望它斷絕於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"與您的期望相比，我們的出發點似乎有些自私自利了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"絕非如此，席德佳修士。衷心認可並呵護自己熱愛的家園，這絕非一件小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"——而您也不必擔心會為修道院帶來許多麻煩，蘭登修道院的立場僅僅是蘭登修道院，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，我可沒有這個意思，歐厄爾先生多慮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，席德佳修士才是，我在您這個年紀，可做不到您這麼沉穩冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"時候不早了，明天我們還會為席德佳修士準備一場晚宴，在此之前，請好好休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......好順利啊。真是個厲害的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好像沒我什麼事了啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我自己能做些什麼呢。\n不知道啊。\n找份工作？可要怎麼樣才能迅速地......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚——怎、怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼每次都會變成這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"你也該習慣了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣在工作途中因為一些意外的爆炸而成為眾人矚目的焦點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著......我看見他了！小偷！別想跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊......這是抓小偷該有的陣仗嗎......偷了什麼東西，這麼不得了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"哪位？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"請進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......沒有打擾姐姐休息吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"......那、那個，只是一個人有有有點不知道幹什麼，畢竟昨天的這個時候，我都在忙著改進我的小型清潔無人機23號......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......23號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，嗯，是的，因為想要試做更簡單的源石電路，結果把窗簾點著了......那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......雖然買了保險......但卡裡的餘額又......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好啦，沒關係，其實你來的正好，你認識下面那群人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"下面？說起來，剛才就好吵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯！往你那邊去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊......是、是企鵝物流的各位啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。我似乎聽過這名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就這麼......呃，在市區車道上用轎車飄移逼停一輛電動車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，嗯，常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"常有的事啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"知道他們叫什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？啊，因為某些工作原因，其實我還挺常見到她們的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"那個開車的帥帥的狼，是德克薩斯。那個拿著錘子追人的很有活力的姐姐，叫可頌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"（都不像是本名呢。我是不是也要考慮一下......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個正在忙著勸架的可愛姐姐是空......以前是個很有名的偶像，果然修道院還是不會聽說這種東西的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"偶像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，呃，歌手，明星，這種感覺吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"明星啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"修道院雖然是有一些戒律清規，但其實也不怎麼嚴......至少這幾年是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"當明星，是什麼感覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想知道啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這家酒店的城際網路電視應該可以點播演唱會錄影的，要不然直接感受下......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......反正時間還早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我來看看......唔......要付費嗎......唔？這個是免費節目......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我其實有想過。\n有想過外面的大地，會是我從未見過的模樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，已經這麼久——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啦......晚安，雪雉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"反而越看越有精神了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"電視啊。雖然修道院裡也有電視來著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"透過這麼小一個方框，能看到整片大地嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......偶像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不我在想什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡西米爾的騎士，好像也不錯啊......但是騎士競技總讓人覺得哪裡怪怪的......有機會的話去看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......萊塔尼亞的術師們似乎也很風光，我記得安潔莉卡姐姐結業之後是去了萊塔尼亞吧，聽說是在音樂學院進修......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......今晚星星真亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"詩人會描摹星星的詞彙，旅人會對夜晚思緒萬千，而我，已經想好了哪顆星星該以我的名字命名。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......您、您是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我之前可看見你從我的酒吧裡出來了。那時我正忙著處理一起小小的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......可那不是峯馳物流的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"歐厄爾？那頭蠢牛買下來了沒錯，但我可還是那裡唯一的酒保！酒吧的靈魂就是酒保！我就是它的靈魂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......等等，等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？是假貨？被掉包了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那還猶豫什麼，炸爛他們的船！對！我說的！什麼？當然要帶上我，你們要獨享嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"（這怎麼看都是非法的吧——！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"歐厄爾和你說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我知道，無非又是借著各種合作項目試著找出一種可能性吧。真辛苦他啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地很精彩，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"但目前的你，缺乏一些開創性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我看你挺順眼的，畢竟保羅·蘭登是個好小夥子，我喜歡他放下銃拿起筆的樣子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"找到他們了，老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"事不宜遲！該讓他們沉進河底了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"保羅·蘭登......修道院創始人？那個奇怪的人在說什麼玩意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來也有這樣的人嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......歐厄爾先生，雖然很失禮，但我在離開龍門前，有個問題無論如何都想問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"您說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼總是在這家酒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......我剛從某個熟人那裡把這裡買下來，我很中意這個氛圍，不吵雜，不骯髒，光鮮亮麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"酒吧一般不是這樣的，至少在龍門是這樣，不知道拉特蘭是......不過修士應該和酒吧無緣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"也不完全是，禮拜日的修士宿舍基本和酒吧沒太大區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我算是明白，為何我和席德佳修士很聊得來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"不過最重要的是，我在某個時刻突然非常中意這個酒吧的名字——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"——“大地的盡頭”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，我們就在“大地的盡頭”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，為了這個項目能帶來理想的結果，乾杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"啟程的時間是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"原定是，明早九點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......原定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......我改主意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"那無論您做什麼打算，需要我們的信使幫助嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必。反正這次離開修道院，也不只是為了一兩件事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是，我要找到自己的信仰該在何處發揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。您有結論了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......很難說是結論......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"我想再看看，這片大地其實......比我想的要有趣點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"很有年輕人風範的答案。我也有個小問題想請教修士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢當，請問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"您覺得......我們的事業，哪怕在未來，真的能被人所認可嗎？拉特蘭的其他聲音，會不會站在我們的對立面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"事物的價值不該在發生之前就去決定，至少，我們會選擇對萬事萬物都尊敬一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是修道院的信條？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"只是拉特蘭的人之常情。還是說，歐厄爾先生只是想考驗一下如今蘭登修道院的態度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡。我只是好奇我如今的合作對象是抱著怎樣的心態工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然不會懷疑自己的生意。只是，當有些事情超出生意的範疇之後，我就不得不在意他人的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......蘭登修道院有一個寓言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"說拉特蘭的某座教堂裡，有一副恢弘的壁畫，描繪了古代英傑們為信仰而戰的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"從各地而來的藝術家，都來品鑑這幅壁畫，他們或讚揚或批判，或是選擇了理性的沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"——這時候，從萊塔尼亞某個小地方來了一位暴發戶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"這位暴發戶體態臃腫，不願爬上教堂的階梯，於是他就遠遠望向教堂的窗戶，隔著窗戶，他看到了畫中的一隻畸形惡獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"於是立刻，這位商人開始詆毀這幅壁畫，他先說聖潔的拉特蘭竟然擺出這種醜惡的畫作，有辱風氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"隨後又說就算是這隻惡獸，也有諸多不可取之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"惡獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"殊不知他所看到的並非壁畫裡的惡獸，而是教堂擺件和燭臺的剪影恰巧給了他這樣的錯覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"他甚至都登不上大雅之堂，卻能從他所見的淺薄碎片中，拆解出更淺薄的見識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"您覺得，問題來自哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"——傲慢，和偏見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"這則寓言的名字就叫做《傲慢的惡獸》。如果真要問一句“教堂憑什麼要修建那麼高的樓梯”，那的確也是一種傲慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"您所想做的事情，就是打碎所有的傲慢，或是至少，在各國、各地、各種族之間不可調和的傲慢中，透過信使這份天職找出一條道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"這其中，甚至包括了自然與生命的傲慢——天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......說實在的，我覺得這很難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"總得有人去做那個墊腳石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......這也是我放心的一點，談錢的時候，咱們就該談錢，現在和歐厄爾先生您可不只是在談錢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在談一份不錯的事業。我對您的執行力深感欽佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，您是這麼想的，我就徹底放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"有機會的話，帶我那兒子去趟拉特蘭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟自從和莫斯提馬有過接觸以後，他眼裡的“信使”這個概念，也就不再那麼狹隘了，挺好——嗯？您怎麼這幅表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......好像聽到了一個不太能忽視的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？原來她那麼有名？我以為她的名聲還是局限在信使業內的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過她被流放之後，我也沒怎麼聽說過她的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔在哪裡都能活得很好吧，畢竟是薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，說的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"......對了，大帝讓我把這個交給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？大帝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"一個很厲害的傢伙。雖然很不著調，但絕對可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是......通訊位址？這是家......公司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"char_332_archet","isRemote":false,"text":"羅......羅德島......是這麼念？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歐厄爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_030","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......偶爾也得相信大帝挑合夥人的品味，也可以相信我，他們和這片大地一樣精彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]},{"speakerId":"char_332_archet","aliases":["席德佳"]},{"speakerId":"char_383_snsant","aliases":["雪雉"]}]}
